Package: camtrapEvents
Title: Metadata-Aware Independence Filtering for Camera-Trap Data
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Samuel", "Awini", email = "winsamuel@hotmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0270-0345"))
Description: Classifies repeated camera-trap records into detection events.
    In addition to a conventional fixed time threshold, observable metadata
    such as group size, age and sex counts, behaviour or identity labels can
    contribute evidence for a new event. Conservative running-maximum and
    optional two-time-scale rules limit repeated splitting as animals move in
    and out of view. Sensitivity tools make the effects of threshold and rule
    choices explicit. Implements and extends the approach applied by Awini et
    al. (2026) <doi:10.1017/S0030605325102500>.
